{"id":"7ca5c842625f1295","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-positive-element.md","title":"Positive Element","display":"df-positive-element — Positive Element","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-positive-element","aliases":["58-df-positive-element"],"display":"df-positive-element — Positive Element","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-cstar-algebra.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-positive-element"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-positive-element</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-positive-element — Positive Element"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"051b1a34c565ddef\" href=\"?note=051b1a34c565ddef\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-cstar-algebra.md\">../batch05/58-df-cstar-algebra.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|,0_A,1_A,a,b\\in V\\land\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\">\\(A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|,0_A,1_A,a,b\\in V\\land\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"051b1a34c565ddef\" href=\"?note=051b1a34c565ddef\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-cstar-algebra.md\">../batch05/58-df-cstar-algebra.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Positive}_S,\\mathrm{PositiveInvertible}_S\\subseteq V^6\\land\\mathrm{Invertible}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{Positive}_S,\\mathrm{PositiveInvertible}_S\\subseteq V^6\\land\\mathrm{Invertible}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (predicates with algebra structure explicit)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^+,A^{++}\\in V\">\\(A^+,A^{++}\\in V\\)</span> (cones defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_A\\;\\subseteq A\\times A\">\\(\\leq_A\\;\\subseteq A\\times A\\)</span> (order on self-adjoint elements defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^+\">\\(A^+\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{++}\">\\(A^{++}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_A\">\\(\\leq_A\\)</span> 均相对于同一固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\">\\((A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b^*=*(b)\">\\(b^*=*(b)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+(a,b)\">\\(+(a,b)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot(a,b)\">\\(\\cdot(a,b)\\)</span> 按有序对取值。严格正锥中的单位元由正文量化，不预设非幺代数有单位元。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}element\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{Positive}_S(a;A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\land a\\in A\\land\\exists b\\in A\\;(a=b^*\\cdot b)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}element\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{Positive}_S(a;A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\land a\\in A\\land\\exists b\\in A\\;(a=b^*\\cdot b)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}element\\text{-}cone} \\vdash A^+\\coloneqq\\{a\\in A:\\mathrm{Positive}_S(a;A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}element\\text{-}cone} \\vdash A^+\\coloneqq\\{a\\in A:\\mathrm{Positive}_S(a;A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}element\\text{-}invertible} \\vdash \\mathrm{Invertible}_S(a;A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A)\\leftrightarrow a,1_A\\in A\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;(1_A\\cdot x=x\\land x\\cdot1_A=x)\\land\\exists b\\in A\\;(a\\cdot b=b\\cdot a=1_A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}element\\text{-}invertible} \\vdash \\mathrm{Invertible}_S(a;A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A)\\leftrightarrow a,1_A\\in A\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;(1_A\\cdot x=x\\land x\\cdot1_A=x)\\land\\exists b\\in A\\;(a\\cdot b=b\\cdot a=1_A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nA^{++}\\coloneqq\\{a\\in A^+:\\exists0_A,1_A\\in A\\;(\\forall x\\in A\\;+(0_A,x)=x\n\\land\\mathrm{Invertible}_S(a;A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nA^{++}\\coloneqq\\{a\\in A^+:\\exists0_A,1_A\\in A\\;(\\forall x\\in A\\;+(0_A,x)=x\n\\land\\mathrm{Invertible}_S(a;A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PositiveInvertible}_S(a;A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\land a\\in A^{++}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PositiveInvertible}_S(a;A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\land a\\in A^{++}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\leq_A b\\leftrightarrow a,b\\in A\\land a=*(a)\\land b=*(b)\n\\land\\exists c\\in A^+\\;+(a,c)=b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\leq_A b\\leftrightarrow a,b\\in A\\land a=*(a)\\land b=*(b)\n\\land\\exists c\\in A^+\\;+(a,c)=b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every positive element has a unique positive square root.</li>\n<li>The displayed order is restricted to self-adjoint elements; the unrelated atom <code>58-df-order</code> concerns order relations on sets.</li>\n<li>States on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^*\">\\(C^*\\)</span>-algebras are positive linear functionals of norm 1.</li>\n<li>The order clause expands <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b-a\">\\(b-a\\)</span> through an additive-inverse witness for the displayed addition and zero, rather than invoking an undeclared subtraction operation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-cstar-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"051b1a34c565ddef","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-cstar-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-cstar-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"051b1a34c565ddef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|,0_A,1_A,a,b\\in V\\land\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)$ (see [[../batch05/58-df-cstar-algebra.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|,0_A,1_A,a,b\\in V\\land\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Positive}_S,\\mathrm{PositiveInvertible}_S\\subseteq V^6\\land\\mathrm{Invertible}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"A^+,A^{++}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_A\\;\\subseteq A\\times A","display":false},{"tex":"A^+","display":false},{"tex":"A^{++}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_A","display":false},{"tex":"(A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)","display":false},{"tex":"b^*=*(b)","display":false},{"tex":"+(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}element\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{Positive}_S(a;A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\land a\\in A\\land\\exists b\\in A\\;(a=b^*\\cdot b)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}element\\text{-}cone} \\vdash A^+\\coloneqq\\{a\\in A:\\mathrm{Positive}_S(a;A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}positive\\text{-}element\\text{-}invertible} \\vdash \\mathrm{Invertible}_S(a;A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A)\\leftrightarrow a,1_A\\in A\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;(1_A\\cdot x=x\\land x\\cdot1_A=x)\\land\\exists b\\in A\\;(a\\cdot b=b\\cdot a=1_A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nA^{++}\\coloneqq\\{a\\in A^+:\\exists0_A,1_A\\in A\\;(\\forall x\\in A\\;+(0_A,x)=x\n\\land\\mathrm{Invertible}_S(a;A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PositiveInvertible}_S(a;A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\land a\\in A^{++}.","display":true},{"tex":"a\\leq_A b\\leftrightarrow a,b\\in A\\land a=*(a)\\land b=*(b)\n\\land\\exists c\\in A^+\\;+(a,c)=b.","display":true},{"tex":"C^*","display":false},{"tex":"b-a","display":false}],"bytes":2374,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-968","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-positive-element.md|58-df-positive-element]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["051b1a34c565ddef"]}